# The pre-#4123 shape: a lost runner's operation reads running forever.
MODULE: LostRunnerReadsFailedNeverDetected
TARGET: LostRunnerReadsFailed
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a read never notices that the runner's silo is dead
PERTURBS: DetectLoss

--- FIND
    /\ Live(o) /\ ~alive[opRunner[o]]
    /\ opState' = [opState EXCEPT ![o] = "Failed"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ Live(o) /\ ~alive[opRunner[o]] /\ alive[opRunner[o]]
    /\ opState' = [opState EXCEPT ![o] = "Failed"]
--- END
